  "term": "cognitive rehabilitation",
  "definition": "Cognitive rehabilitation is a rehabilitation approach focused on cognitive recovery. In this source, it refers to an early intervention examined in people with mild traumatic brain injury for its association with later cognitive, functional, and biomarker outcomes.",
